13.Copy data of emp table in any other table and fire a  query on new table, so that the data will not get affected. Increase the salary by 10% in the database for all employees having experience more than 40 years 
    CREATE TABLE emp1 AS
    SELECT * FROM emp;
    
UPDATE emp1
